    y <= y*:       max |log10(nu_mono/nu_RAR)| = 9.97e-42 dex (identical by construction)
    (y*, y_p]:     max |log10(nu_mono/nu_RAR)| = 9.06978e-5 dex
    L340's grid construction vs this closed form, y in 1e-3..1e4: max 1.4e-09 dex
  [PASS] S3 nu_mono = nu_RAR identically for y <= y*; on (y*, y_p] they differ by at most 9.1e-5 dex (not zero); L340's grid construction matches the closed form to <= 1e-7 dex
         measured: below y*: 1.0e-41; band: 9.07e-5 dex; grid vs closed: 1.4e-09 dex
         reading:  the recipe's 'below the peak nu_mono = nu_RAR' should read 'for y <= y* = 2.3374'

